description	"Talz Pirate

Indigenous Pirates equipped with scavenged gear and a cold, cold arsenal.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Flat Kb: 85
- Melee Weapon
-- Pulses On hit
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- Electro Staff (Staff)
-- Dual Electro Batons (Dual)
-- Vibro Sword (Purple/Red)

^5Powers:
- Talz Fury (3) ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- 40% less Kb Taken
- Dexterity (1)
- Strength (1)
- Fury (3)
- Getup (2)
- Healing (2)
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Barge ^3[CS3]
- Binoculars ^3[CS4]"